      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كسج</span></b> , [app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسِجَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَجَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كسج</span>,
[app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَجٌ</span>,] <i>He had no beard grown;</i> [<i>was
